BT /F3 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 688 Tm (Hook: Being prepared doesn't mean you're expecting something to go wrong.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 676 Tm (Script: It means you don't want a small problem to ruin a great day outside. A dead flashlight. A) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 664 Tm (missing tool. Weather changing faster than expected. The point of preparedness is simple: handle the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 652 Tm (little things so you can keep focusing on the adventure. Pack smart. Know your gear. Then get outside.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 637 Tm (Visual direction: Quick cuts of packing a bag, checking gear, testing a flashlight, and heading outdoors.) Tj ET
