BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 579 Tm (Script: Check your light. Check your water. Check the basics you actually depend on. Then ask yourself) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 567 Tm (one question: if something small goes wrong, can I deal with it? That one-minute check can make your) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 555 Tm (day a lot easier. Good adventures start with good preparation.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 540 Tm (Visual direction: First-person gear check with close-up shots and quick labels.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 528 Tm (CTA: Save this for your next trip.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 512 Tm (Short-Form Video Script 3 - Pack for the Adventure) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 494 Tm (Hook: The best gear is the gear you actually know how to use.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 482 Tm (Script: You can have a bag full of equipment, but that doesn't automatically make you prepared. Know) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 470 Tm (what you packed. Know where it is. Practice using the things you rely on. Preparedness is less about) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 458 Tm (carrying everything and more about being ready to use what you carry.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 443 Tm (Visual direction: Show gear being removed from a pack and briefly demonstrated.) Tj ET
